      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Weapons and passives have upgrades that can be offered when you level
    up. Weapon upgrades will typically buff a stat of the weapon, whereas passive
    buff the player''s stats which are then applied to all weapons you have.


    Upgrades
    are offered in different rarities, with higher rarities increasing the stat buff
    the upgrade offered. Rarities are: Common, Rare, Epic and Legendary.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 719f80d5e5f25694ca887ff4b91e2905, type: 2}
