  m_text: 'Blaze Boots

    Periodically drops a circle of fire beneath you which
    lasts a few seconds. Damages and inflicts Burn on enemies.


    Upgrades may
    increase damage, attack speed (drop rate), duration, crit chance or it''s area.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
