  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Monster King Transformation is a core part of your power from the
    beginning of the game. It comes with an inherent attack, Fangs, which inflicts
    bleeding on enemies that it hits. You also have an energy bar, which, when full,
    allows you to transform. While transformed you increase your movement speed,
    the attack speed of your Fangs, and causes all your weapons to inflict bleeding
    on enemies. \nYour transformation also has 3 upgrades and you're able to choose
    one every 10 levels."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 719f80d5e5f25694ca887ff4b91e2905, type: 2}
